From b1cc79409c44952b454afa721a46223c9e58701d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: liuxiansheng <liuxiansheng@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:06:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(qq-music-free): attach MediaSession token to the
 MediaStyle notification

QQ Music Lite posts a MediaStyle notification but never puts the session
token into `android.mediaSession`, so SystemUI treats it as an ordinary
ongoing notification and never creates the media island / media card.

Hook points:
- capture `MediaSession.sessionToken` on constructor and on setPlaybackState
- patch missing `android.mediaSession` extra before NotificationManager.notify,
  notifyAsPackage and Service.startForeground (never overwrite an existing token)

Only the qq-music-free module is touched.
